('31c455a6-cfd7-5893-96e8-c8c833279131', '157573de-e4fd-418b-9e2b-b4772e5fe137', 'b2e3d430-7699-4dac-9f55-e84c5cd5ce9b', 'a-level', '1.4', '9702 coursebook 1.4 · Displacement–time graphs', 28, 28, 'An object moves so that s = 2.0t² (s in m, t in s). Calculate the average velocity between t = 1.0 s and t = 3.0 s.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '8', 'm s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, 's(1.0) = 2.0 m; s(3.0) = 18 m. v = (18 − 2.0) ÷ (3.0 − 1.0) = 8.0 m s⁻¹. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: both displacements. C1: gradient of chord. A1: v = 8.0 m s⁻¹.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg8dea372a-t fg8dea372a-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg8dea372a-t">s = 2.0t²</title><desc id="fg8dea372a-d">The curve s = 2.0t² from 0 to 3.5 s with a dashed chord joining the points at t = 1.0 s and t = 3.0 s.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="79.8" y1="34" x2="79.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="130.2" y1="34" x2="130.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="180.5" y1="34" x2="180.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="230.9" y1="34" x2="230.9" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="281.3" y1="34" x2="281.3" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="331.6" y1="34" x2="331.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-wi