('8b870d2a-548a-5fda-a2e0-472dff1aa338', '157573de-e4fd-418b-9e2b-b4772e5fe137', 'b2e3d430-7699-4dac-9f55-e84c5cd5ce9b', 'a-level', '1.4', '9702 coursebook 1.4 · Displacement–time graphs', 44, 44, 'A tangent to a curved s–t graph at t = 4.0 s passes through (1.0 s, 0 m) and (6.0 s, 40 m). A tangent at t = 8.0 s passes through (5.0 s, 20 m) and (10 s, 100 m). (a) Calculate both velocities. (b) Calculate the average acceleration.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '2', 'm s⁻²', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 40 ÷ 5.0 = 8.0 m s⁻¹ and 80 ÷ 5.0 = 16 m s⁻¹. (b) a = (16 − 8.0) ÷ (8.0 − 4.0) = 2.0 m s⁻². Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: first gradient. C1: second gradient. M1: a = Δv/Δt. C1: value. A1: a = 2.0 m s⁻².', 5, NULL, NULL),
('616368d1-0056-57ae-afa9-b8ea0458191c', '157573de-e4fd-418b-9e2b-b4772e5fe137', 'b2e3d430-7699-4dac-9f55-e84c5cd5ce9b', 'a-level', '1.4', '9702 coursebook 1.4 · Displacement–time graphs', 45, 45, 'A walker leaves home at 1.5 m s⁻¹. 200 s later her brother leaves home along the same path at 2.5 m s⁻¹. (a) Write s for each in terms of t (from when she leaves). (b) Calculate when he catches her. (c) Calculate how far from home this is.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '750', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) s₁ = 1.5t; s₂ = 2.5(t − 200). (b) 1.5t = 2.5t − 500 gives t = 500 s. (c) s = 1.5 × 500 = 750 m. Mark scheme (6 marks). B1: first equation. B1: second equation with delay. M1: equate. C1: t. C1: distance. A1: s = 750 m.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg6db54846-t fg6db54846-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg6db54846-t">Walker and brother</title><desc id="fg6db54846-d">Displacement–time lines: the walker from home at 1.5 m s⁻¹ from t = 0, her brother from home at 2.5 m s⁻¹ from t = 200 s.</desc><line x1="42.9" y1="34" x2="42.9" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="91.3" y1="34" x2="91.3" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="139.8" y1="34" x2="139.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="188.2" y1="34" x2="188.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="236.7" y1="34" x2="236.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="285.1" y1="34" x2="285.1" 